           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4916-7296"))
Description:An end-to-end quantitative genomics and molecular breeding suite 
    for crops. Identifies superior functional haplotypes from coding 
    variants under false discovery rate control and conducts haplotype-guided 
    genomic selection, analytical cross usefulness prediction, and linkage-aware 
    pyramiding optimization.
